:_ :get 0 9 7 2_ 0 9 7 2 Reset: a page on the radio, not a setting
:_ :get 0 9 8_ 0 9 8 About: v0.9.4
:_ :get 0 9 9_ a menu number from MENU, e.g. 0 7 1 (Theme)
:_ :get 0 9 9 1_ 0 9 9 1 Advanced squelch: a page on the radio, not a setting
:_ :get 0 9 9 2_ 0 9 9 2 Calibration: Not checked
:_ :get 0 9 9 3_ 0 9 9 3 Terminal colour: Off
:_ :get 0 9 9 4_ 0 9 9 4 MCU clock: Dynamic
-- knob and #
