# One command per line, as typed after : in the terminal; :load reads it back. # starts a note.
# Channels and zones are merged by number: lines replace what they name, nothing else is deleted.
# Settings, by their numbers in the radio's menu
set 0 1 1 A+B                     # Watch
set 0 1 2 10 s                    # Resume
set 0 1 3 Every 250 s             # Priority check
set 0 1 6 1 1 min                 # Pause time
set 0 1 6 2 Up                    # Direction
set 0 1 6 3 Off                   # Scan inputs
set 0 1 6 4 Start                 # Return to
set 0 2 4 Name                    # Channel shows
set 0 2 5 50 km                   # Local zone
set 0 2 6 1 100 kHz               # Step
set 0 2 6 2 Auto                  # AGC
set 0 2 6 3 On                    # Radio monitor
set 0 2 6 4 90 min                # Sleep timer
set 0 3 1 1 120                   # Bars
set 0 3 1 2 50 kHz                # Step
set 0 3 1 3 10.0 ms               # Sweep speed
set 0 3 1 4 Monitor               # Trigger
set 0 3 1 5 Off                   # Waterfall row
set 0 4 2 1 Off                   # Decode
set 0 4 2 2 439.987               # Frequency
set 0 4 2 3 None                  # Capcode filter
set 0 4 3 On                      # DTMF decode
set 0 4 4 On                      # Popups
set 0 5 3 Off                     # APRS mode
set 0 5 4 144.390                 # Frequency
set 0 5 5 1 7 Handheld            # SSID
set 0 5 5 2 Person                # Symbol
set 0 5 5 3 None                  # Comment
set 0 5 5 4 GPS                   # Position source
set 0 5 5 6 Exact                 # Ambiguity
set 0 5 5 7 Off                   # Mic-E
set 0 5 6 1 Off                   # Mode
set 0 5 6 2 Off                   # After voice TX
set 0 5 6 3 Low                   # Power
set 0 5 6 4 Off                   # Telemetry
set 0 5 6 5 All                   # Text rate
set 0 5 7 1 Off                   # Digipeat
set 0 5 7 2 WIDE1-1               # Aliases
set 0 5 7 3 0 s                   # Wait
set 0 5 8 Cable                   # KISS TNC
set 0 5 9 1 WIDE1-1,WIDE2-1       # Path
set 0 5 9 2 None                  # Custom path
set 0 5 9 3 300 ms                # TX delay
set 0 5 9 4 Mid                   # TX level
set 0 5 9 5 16 bytes              # FX.25 on TX
set 0 5 9 6 On                    # Mute speaker
set 0 5 9 7 APRS first            # Shared VHF
set 0 5 9 8 Off                   # Decode log
set 0 5 9 9 Off                   # Auto reply
set 0 6 1 Auto                    # GPS
set 0 6 3 DMS                     # Coordinates
set 0 6 4 Imperial                # Units
set 0 6 5 UTC+5:30                # Time zone
set 0 6 6 24 h, GPS               # Clock
set 0 6 8 Transmit                # GPS off during
set 0 7 1 Night red               # Theme
set 0 7 2 Single + scope          # Layout
set 0 7 3 1 Bars                  # S-meter
set 0 7 3 2 Callsign              # Power-on text
set 0 7 3 3 Logo                  # Boot screen
set 0 7 4 1 5 min                 # Timeout
set 0 7 4 2 1                     # Brightness
set 0 7 4 3 On                    # On transmit
set 0 7 4 4 Keys and RX           # Wake on
set 0 7 4 5 On key press          # Key light
set 0 7 5 1 On                    # Key beep
set 0 7 5 2 High                  # Beep volume
set 0 7 5 3 On                    # Alert tones
set 0 7 5 4 On                    # Arrival tone
set 0 7 5 5 Packet                # Message sound
set 0 7 5 6 Max                   # Message volume
set 0 7 6 RX and TX               # LEDs
set 0 7 7 1 Level 1               # Battery Save
set 0 7 7 2 Auto                  # Low Power Mode
set 0 7 7 3 20 %                  # Auto below
set 0 7 8 Off                     # Auto power off
set 0 7 9 30 s                    # Menu timeout
set 0 8 1 120 s                   # Timeout
set 0 8 2 1 Off                   # VOX
set 0 8 2 2 9                     # Level
set 0 8 2 3 3 s                   # Tail
set 0 8 3 5                       # Mic gain
set 0 8 4 Chirp                   # End tone
set 0 8 5 3 200 ms                # Speed
set 0 8 5 4 On                    # Sidetone
set 0 8 5 5 1000 ms               # Start delay
set 0 8 6 2 Every 10 min          # CW ID
set 0 8 7 Off                     # Busy lockout default
set 0 8 8 1 Normal                # Subtone level
set 0 8 8 2 Transmit              # Tail removal
set 0 8 8 3 180°                 # Phase
set 0 9 1 1 Off                   # Auto lock
set 0 9 2 1 Off                   # Bluetooth
set 0 9 2 3 Link                  # Cable port
set 0 9 5 Software                # Squelch
set 0 9 9 3 Off                   # Terminal colour
set 0 9 9 4 Dynamic               # MCU clock
# 0 9 4 Region: Not set (changes only on the radio)
# Zones (a channel's zone=N is one of these)
# Range presets (0 1 4)
# Channels (21 of 4000)
end
