A  VFO                   145.50000   NFM               idle       active  B  VFO                   433.50000   NFM               idle :_ :set 0 1 1 xyzzy_ Watch: one of A+B, A+B+C, Off
:_ :set 0 1 1 on_ Watch: one of A+B, A+B+C, Off
:_ :set 0 1 1 off_ 0 1 1 Watch: Off
:_ :set 0 1 1 1_ Watch: one of Off, A+B, A+B+C
:_ :set 0 1 1 2_ Watch: one of Off, A+B, A+B+C
:_ :set 0 1 1 10_ Watch: one of Off, A+B, A+B+C
:_ :set 0 1 1 none_ Watch: one of Off, A+B, A+B+C
:_ :set 0 1 2 xyzzy_ Resume: one of 5 s, 6 s, 7 s, 8 s, 9 s, 10 s, Carrier drop, Stop on hit, 1 s, 2
:_ :set 0 1 2 on_ Resume: one of 5 s, 6 s, 7 s, 8 s, 9 s, 10 s, Carrier drop, Stop on hit, 1 s, 2
:_ :set 0 1 2 off_ Resume: one of 5 s, 6 s, 7 s, 8 s, 9 s, 10 s, Carrier drop, Stop on hit, 1 s, 2
:_ :set 0 1 2 1_ 0 1 2 Resume: 1 s
:_ :set 0 1 2 2_ 0 1 2 Resume: 2 s
:_ :set 0 1 2 10_ 0 1 2 Resume: 10 s
:_ :set 0 1 2 none_ Resume: one of 10 s, Carrier drop, Stop on hit, 1 s, 2 s, 3 s, 4 s, 5 s, 6 s, 7
:_ :set 0 1 3 xyzzy_ Priority check: one of Every 2 s, Every 3 s, Every 4 s, Every 5 s, Off, Every 1
